      *C
      *C  03/14/94       JS BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO ESTABLISH THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER FOR
      *C     THIS PROGRAM.
      *C
      *C  09/16/1996     CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C

001900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002300 SPECIAL-NAMES. C01 IS NEWPAGE.
002500
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002700 FILE-CONTROL.
002800     SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
