047400
047500 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
047600
047700
047800
047900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
048000
048100 PROC-DIV SECTION 01.
048200
048300
048400 1-BEGIN.
048500     PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.
048600
048700     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.
048800
048900     PERFORM 2-EOJ  THRU 2-EOJ-X.
049000
049100     GOBACK.
049200
049300
049400
049500 1-HSK.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, MSTORERM-I, DDESC-I, USAGEFIL-I.
050100
051300     OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.
051400
051500**************************************************
051600*                                                *
051700*   GET CO. AND PRIME FROM MPLTINFO              *
051800*   USING 'P 01' AS THE ARGUMENT                 *
051900*                                                *
052000**************************************************
052100
052200     MOVE "P 01"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
052600         MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO 1-HSK P 01"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
052700         MOVE PLT-ARG                      TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
052800         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
052900     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY     TO  PRT-CO.
053000
053100     MOVE 1                    TO  DATE-MODE.
053200     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
053300     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT       TO  PRT-DATE.
053400     MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT  TO  PRT-TIME.
053500
053600 1-H-X.
053700     EXIT.
053800
053900
054000 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I, MSTORERM-I, DDESC-I, USAGEFIL-I.
055000
055100     CLOSE ONLINE-PRT.
055200
055300 2-EOJ-X.
055400     EXIT.
055500
055600*********************************************
055700*                                           *
055800*  BLOWUP ROUTINE EXECUTES WHENEVER A       *
055900*  FATAL ERROR OCCURS                       *
056000*                                           *
056100*********************************************
056200
056300 2-BLOWUP.
056400     MOVE "TCALCEXP"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
056500     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
056600         DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
056700                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
056800
056900
057000
